<title>USA: Kemper Funds joins Schwab OneSource.</title>
<headline>Kemper Funds joins Schwab OneSource.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kemper Funds said it signed an agreement for Class A shares of 22 of its mutual funds to be distributed through Charles Schwab Corp's Institutional OneSource program.</p>
<p>The funds are already distrributed through Fidelity Institutional FundsNetwork and Jack White &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Kemper is a unit of Zurich Insurance Co.</p>
</text>
